                        # before open-import name fallback because multiple public
                        # impls may intentionally expose the same method name.
                        # Gate the global resolution-table scans on actual call
                        # syntax in the receiver. Most flow calls use a lexical
                        # binding and must not pay an O(all calls) fallback cost.
